                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I first played this game on the iPad years ago when it first came out. I love strategy and tower defense games. This game is a pure gem, I would suggest starting on hard mode to give yourself a challenge, the computer gives you a tough enough challenge through the different stages. Building up momentum gives your soldiers a moral boost to capture objectives much quicker. Use that moral to help you in the harder stages, you will need it. The soundtrack is also amazing, at least to me! Sadly this game is no longer available on the iPad, so to my surprise when I saw it was available on STEAM I purchased it without hesitation. It's successor Mushroom Wars 2 is on the iPad though. It is filled with micro transactions and ads!! It's clear the developer got greedy after the success of the first game. If you like strategy games I would definitely add this one to your collection. Money well spent!",
